---
source: src/main.rs
expression: "render_help_snapshot(&[\"cases\", \"run\"])"
---
Run saved cases for an endpoint

Usage: hooklistener cases run [OPTIONS] <ENDPOINT_ID>

Arguments:
  <ENDPOINT_ID>  Debug endpoint ID

Options:
      --target <TARGET>      Target: a URL, a saved target ID, or cli for the running listen session
      --target-name <NAME>   Display name recorded for the target
      --wait                 Wait for the run to complete before returning
      --timeout <DURATION>   Timeout for --wait, such as 60, 2m, or 1h
      --interval <DURATION>  Poll interval for --wait, such as 500ms, 2s, or 10s
  -o, --org <ORG_ID>         Organization ID (overrides the configured default)
  -h, --help                 Print help

Global options:
      --json               Output supported command responses or event streams as JSON
      --color <COLOR>      Styling policy for human output [default: auto] [possible values: auto,
                           always, never]
      --yes                Confirm destructive commands without an interactive prompt
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn,
                           error]
      --log-dir <DIR>      Directory for log files
      --log-stdout         Also write logs to stdout
